                        These terms are governed by the laws of Kenya
                        including the Kenya Data Protection Act 2019,
                        the Kenya Information and Communications Act,
                        and the Consumer Protection Act. Any disputes
                        shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the
                        Kenyan courts.
                    </p>
                    <hr class="my-4" />
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">26. Changes to These Terms</h5>
                    <p>
                        We reserve the right to update these terms at any
                        time. Continued use of the system after changes
                        are published constitutes acceptance.
                        Significant changes will be communicated with
                        at least 14 days notice.
                    </p>
